# D3-EN-005: Heating the enzyme source rather than the protein substrate
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 30mL @ 25C
add v1 pineapple 5g
add v2 water 30mL @ 25C
add v2 pineapple 5g
heat v1 9kJ
measure v1 thermometer
wait 2min
cool v1 9kJ
measure v1 thermometer
measure v2 thermometer
add v1 gelatin 0.5g
add v2 gelatin 0.5g
wait 45min
look v1
look v2
inspect
